elieves they are sent by the old  gods the old gods stir and will not let  me sleep we know that a top high heart  lies a circle of chopped down where with  trees we do not know what this place was  once used for but it was likely a place  of great power for the children of the  forest if the ghost of high heart is  hearing whispers from the old gods this  could mean only one thing the children  of the forest are involved in some way  take a closer look at Jenny of Old Stone  and the story seems to clear even more  Prince Duncan discovered her whilst  traveling through the Riverlands  she lived rather crudely half-wild  amongst ancient ruins and claimed  herself to be descended from ancient  kings of the first men the small folk in  the villages near Jenny's ruins mocked  her however insisting that she was mad  and perhaps even a witch Jenny and the  ghost have appeared to be very close the  ghost even accompanied Jenny to court  according to the world of Ice and Fire  and even more strangely Jenny herself  claimed that the woman was a child of  the forest though different and  appearance the ghosts of high heart has  a few physical indicators that would tie  her to the children bloodraven told bran  that amongst the children of the forest  most had green or yellow eyes but one in  every thousand had red eyes and was a  green seer the ghost has red eyes the  children are also said to be as small as  children  the ghost is described as a dwarf woman  is it possible that she gets close  ancestry with the children but how could  this be possible when the children had  not been seen in Westeros for thousands  of years they may have not been seen but  that does not mean at the  not there according to lief one of the  children of the forest she had traveled  the lands of Westeros hidden in the  shadows for at least two centuries leaf  was born in the time of the Dragon  meaning during the reign of the  Targaryen Kings and left Westeros with a  weary heart leaf is also the only one of  the children of the forest in blood  Ravens cave that speaks the common  tongue little is known about the anatomy  of the children of the forest but is it  possible that the ghosts of high heart  is somehow descended from leaf and may  perhaps even be her daughter this would  explain why she left Westeros with a  weary heart knowing that she left her  child behind but let's not stop there  there was a reason that Ginny and the  ghost of high heart were so close there  is a reason that even after nearly half  a century  the ghost still grieves for Ginny and  asks only for a song of her in exchange  for her dreams there is a reason that  Ginny was viewed as strange by the small  folk and lived amongst ruins in the  forests of the Riverlands that's right  I'm suggesting that Ginny and the ghost  of high heart were more than just  friends  I am suggesting that the ghost and Jenny  are mother and daughter both likely with  the blood of the children of the forest  and the first men but this brings up  another question why would lief have a  half-human child in the first place  perhaps the reason is because a child  that was at least part human would blend  in easier amongst humans leaf also said  that she walked Westeros to listen and  learn it would make sense that after she  retreated back to the far north that the  children would want someone else in the  south to keep an eye on humanity  the ghost in fact does seem to be still  in contact with the children mentioning  that the old gods whispered to her at  night aka the weirwood trees and Jenny  votes on herself would have been queen  of all the Seven Kingdoms if not for  Duncan renouncing his crown in favor of  his younger brother at the center of all  the kingdom's politics and drama she  would have been the perfect spy for the  children of the forest it would have  been the perfect place for her to listen  and learn just as lief had done for 200  years but her life was instead claimed  by the fires at